{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_05",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7aca20e4c92e073da30af3ae569c891010727b9e384cdcaae49bac06a06a2216",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e41aaa392468150a87f4fb1a762831433ecf88b977c83c554c737bb7a26c74",
      "text": "跨越时空的邂逅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c946da8e99d79727f98afa39df62649d0b73daf75e2210f8809a6da00767b85",
      "text": "彩将在男极“同步部门”中，演唱以\n观众寄来的“回忆信件”为蓝本创作的\n歌曲。\n为了与信中的情感同步，他们前往了写信人的\n故乡，也是九郎的故乡——镰仓。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f4fe9663b1c30cef05a726883179c94adc263067b1d6df8b2aef98e90574c49",
      "text": "第5话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62e41aaa392468150a87f4fb1a762831433ecf88b977c83c554c737bb7a26c74",
      "text": "跨越时空的邂逅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4212176da6ba3521378ad8b10b8d7475c150e5159b95d4fb0f1bbf0262d2e14",
      "text": "镰仓",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bc6dce17c6c349dd951ae73019caa75803f9ae274adce9d8467bf41101843fc",
      "text": "紫薯冰淇淋，可真好吃喵。\n到现在嘴里还洋溢着满满的幸福感喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a47cd548cfa5a2c0b3edaf67deca18abe40d3d44e5929122e31ba7600ee7f93",
      "text": "镰仓有好多美食呢。\n刚烤好的仙贝也超级美味呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc06985e68e38f80d5c67e702b1213a9c643d45d542a39896965db8603737ef1",
      "text": "你们两个，居然玩得这么开心……\n我们可不是来玩的哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a3f69b4e8d7065fbf4e0485cd67793c12526b1588f1a940818b43ba5f0e6064",
      "text": "男极“同步部门”是要根据观众寄来的\n回忆信件所创作的歌曲来进行演唱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd9f453ea13055b3144ed60681002a89b9c5ebff0468adda3c3a43168c388ad0",
      "text": "能否带来贴近人心的舞台表演，\n我们必须展现出这份实力才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:171ad610920077034d4ea2a2b3875e75707b5ccb96dab0cc90c3aa95367adfab",
      "text": "彩负责的就是那封信呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:110ee2e5658029846d88258d3ba99eae75f87010cca3cae4c9792da1d5c892ce",
      "text": "是的。从这上面写着的“笹龙胆”和\n“海棠”来推测，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0daf6b7a70749f58b184f8ca29a7b04df8813129b358608e638cc9e9b4d6528",
      "text": "寄信人曾经居住的地方大概就是镰仓吧。\n笹龙胆是镰仓市的市徽呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8bb21c07c44b751a7d5b04e465a62b1c9c81ce56a46d9f528556f3ffa20c129",
      "text": "这封信似乎是离开镰仓的寄信人，\n写给故乡友人的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cb349b825610a3753f223ee5a2b4ed1cfb556ad19afca30a3e23ba6f218b4de",
      "text": "游历镰仓体会信中的心意，\n并在当天的音乐节目中完美地演唱出来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29fa9925863254dff7e0b2982b5f2712f9da426a8a769c8dc6302072d02b6467",
      "text": "下一场男极“同步部门”的胜利者，非彩莫属！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6045133be6304db99a55c3ea83ef7de0820bf6ff4fca268db0f5a4d7766b8dfb",
      "text": "那是当然的喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_a:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:045d3fddbf9681d26f581c7f6b6e2708630ce24715d3d2cd25787056c4cd9cbc",
      "text": "我们当然是这么打算的啦。\n……不过有件事稍微有点让人在意呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6f97a192863820d732f42e39682f38faebc07ffccd6e662eafe7414516468c",
      "text": "为什么唯独交给我们彩的信件，会这么古旧\n破烂呢？其他事务所的可不是这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214fa1aa958cd7b04975cd4da18c3d19805ad2cfd59cc5c272902308af5919cc",
      "text": "嗯。虽然我也像“速度部门”时那样，\n跟工作人员确认过有没有搞错……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01084bcd3294d47ad38e0b9365ce273399d51699fbc67c230fd6a0c01dbe0b6d",
      "text": "对方说是“没错的”对吧？\n哼……可疑的事情还真是一桩接一桩呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:969ce5e29585a93732eae4e7d6e3e616c81c6535b606d3133b7a2049de484ca8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君！\n那边有特产店喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0726c0e191cc798fa5c7e3ff49e758b040a593d1823c7e3521b190c3290d9317",
      "text": "哎呀，真不错呢♪\n稍微顺路去看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7e990dfbf928291cab04e231351101612ddf3aeb5e3699914dfb6da13b3a2c0",
      "text": "也想给事务所的大家买点伴手礼呢。\n●●●●プロデューサー酱，我们走吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5331488a28c72c4c4f289c4c0d9a231d3e92a78f2f94378bbc8b6a727b76230c",
      "text": "挑选特产也完全是为了工作对吧？\n可不能太得意忘形……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5eb4fffbc96ca7638f1bf03bd0693fe6e44e64675b843aaac8dec6357b21501",
      "text": "嘴上这么说，九郎酱。自己故乡的镰仓\n能被大家感兴趣，高兴的心情完全藏不住呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b87305c5c2a9ad6aeb814c78efb2ba572acfd6d58112926fad91c146817fc9b3",
      "text": "话虽如此，\n刚才不也陪我们一路逛吃过来了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad515753e956c105db5c1bbfc627821ee3b9cf9b9f271cffeb14aa2fb9c358ec",
      "text": "好吃的仙贝店和冰淇淋店，\n也都是九郎君告诉我们的喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7725df113ce527b5e1d73b8bd575632db0905dafe411bb6e96f679ec496bbfea",
      "text": "那、那纯粹只是为了让大家\n加深对这片土地的理解……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_b:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5010ca1aa49521688e25597dc2c1676bbb90f5c07255f8df7d7f06dbae8c4ac",
      "text": "不过，给事务所的大家买特产这件事我还是\n赞成的。那家店的话就由我来带路吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d133ff166661f4f64b111a5f6c5bfb431e58189536ea9e02352b29e194af82",
      "text": "与此同时，在事务所……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:543915416d33abf9eba560ef917405b927a6f19a07ca977b4b0e8e31b188e9d1",
      "text": "喂，仆从跑哪去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46cf1e0f152598b9500c0438b68794dd4e735ee1647ee1e7c50ad86ae123d014",
      "text": "之前不是说过了吗，制作人今天要和彩一起出外勤，\n一整天都不在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb5f1463b99278c2f4284b9d4f5fed4c995e3a29069e73b548ad60c0adb18f55",
      "text": "训练菜单已经留在这里了。\n赶紧看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2398064845d6528ed4dff0f2272d0ab0fdbb3ef326b79517e30ea43c3368c14f",
      "text": "啊？本大爷才不需要什么练习呢。\n我和你们这群凡人可不一样，蠢货！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cb49bd9d5daeca33ee913a08d32ef0cb3ab34d2b5c4c51960fbeecf406de3c9",
      "text": "……你只是不想正视自己的实力吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:765fa3909c456a900a9f746e81bc51a80a09e484664df6dbd2bf3313a8edcf48",
      "text": "上次的格斗游戏舞台上，\n也是我把现场气氛调动得更热烈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61861c9237836544439acb3e4d5faa6c1ab53b2ecfea323d2d7e25208a7c5ff2",
      "text": "你要消沉耍脾气我不管，\n但那样你永远都会比我弱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:876ee1256dd56198a4d9e8b664f3517422531368ff49337f02eb711654c40a09",
      "text": "你这家伙……眼珠子到底长没长啊！？\n怎么看都是本大爷表现得更好吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a9fbb78895f5c6289eda391a24bba0d3ca1c4065a5a9d5cc32e2f644d21fce1",
      "text": "喂，把那张纸给我！下次也一定要由本大爷\n把观众们给引爆得尖叫连连！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db44281132465664f8bbfe661a21e65af0cd25ade26ff6923b32cd469aeeff80",
      "text": "哈哈，今天也很有活力呢。练习之前\n要不要吃点这个稍微冷静一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a59868f3c09488d03087a472b88a00aa5a4b166a9bbcf3d6563cfe6c5d9686a",
      "text": "啥啊那是，吃的吗？\n库哈哈，本大爷全包了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3243b049995067416d21d711fa0f94d29544f50bc9edd0c2e451f6938397ca6b",
      "text": "不能全吃掉哦，涟。这可是九郎特意\n为THE 虎牙道的大家准备的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca37a6905e6878f8677127ea3b660b63b242efc54e588fe83c65c0a50d93195b",
      "text": "九郎先生给的？为什么给我们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_c:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aefb1d313a6244b0565509106ac01eedfe58dfe6b8541efacddec0f85746634",
      "text": "其实是昨天在事务所遇到的时候……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:926595d5707f8fa0894c90b2e0c606ad02748f9acb595c7d248a5982f6f8cc45",
      "text": "昨天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56b6affd8d492b0cd0e3cd91764b688057eb7cb8d249917e497dbbca98b08b31",
      "text": "圆城寺先生。如果不嫌弃的话，请收下这个。\n请务必和THE 虎牙道的各位一起享用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8379fe9f3c0ae1a67c433f2326bd932924182537d2270672e0cc1b7494b5ebbe",
      "text": "哦，是日式点心啊。谢谢！\n每种看起来都很好吃，外观也很可爱呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267adfc38f24e74e3d8b6095ec8df9e946fbccb4fe26cb986278f73b33ff37f2",
      "text": "不过，为什么给我们呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb0513384da15b359a840cec5d822d2b6a5cf6251c9526ba350832c133b0b4fa",
      "text": "我听说明天●●●●プロデューサー先生，\n原本是预定要陪同各位练习的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df663537ea4593b5b60da71ef4ea9581631da8489f5c7df1cd1886cff69e14ec",
      "text": "因为我们调整了行程，\n所以希望能借此表达一点歉意……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:526240c77c63f6dd0b5013021fa6c40c715547ddd08daa1fc48ff3805f1ed06b",
      "text": "啊哈哈，原来是这样啊。\n九郎真的很会体贴照顾人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66e1c56b36b6cfd49408d5fa854b2de7f47bb505264bd20b6fc37bfb2ea9b853",
      "text": "毕竟平时我都是和非常随性自我的人们\n在一起行动呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e4c07734309277bc9d8a22ba8053a6715d6234006f3a76841e90aa4621d9bb4",
      "text": "哦，那跟我们组合挺像的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6fb1145f7a8e7671da05cefd2ba17eb979065083adc365ae7e2ca189f6dab61",
      "text": "我家武和涟也正值顽皮好动的年纪，\n前几天的练习里还发生了这样的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a051bbf38d19f90896f28d8fdac72d67593ad34990533c99198ff0be09ae52e",
      "text": "竟然还有这种事……！\n不过，彩前些日子也发生过类似的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:807320ce96d21e96a6dd974358dd51ca2530b9f834167c07717ba80254fb5ee9",
      "text": "……就像两个在为育儿烦恼的\n家长一样聊得热火朝天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7fbd00b815f5ce697a1a4d9335292f0ee15fd829baf036610ca945311997cd2",
      "text": "不过，被组合里任性的同伴\n耍得团团转的人，感觉还有其他人在呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea01475b00d137a9c838385e1e0bb46ced9d0c8266c97f7271390d0d6eb6cc2",
      "text": "找个机会办一次“315 Pro家长会”试试看吧！\n哈哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b2045ef295e891d45d5d7dbcd119bb29921a50d21a87c9d8db62e36180823f0",
      "text": "……给圆城寺先生添麻烦了我道歉，\n但我不想被跟这家伙混为一谈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2781ecd04a032b382a8221e3ec2b000b599b9504a66bbc2e88b92e6556df0ad0",
      "text": "这话该我说才对，小不点！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2db405a49996db1899a8b6dad8190db6943d7e152f5bca7bb44a6d7528c1736",
      "text": "不过你们俩在互相较劲的时候，\n比起面对其他对手都要更有斗志不是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4",
      "text": "那是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0510f5a2e09058b2bbcc1bdf547eba17aa48317c25758d6c74b77a0bd689521d",
      "text": "不，怎么可能有这回事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_d:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c78f9bc9a34bdc7e94d3442cb7594075c878b8751cd2f396024dd02caace32",
      "text": "别说恶心人的话，大蠢货！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70eda907af0856ff6c36f4093e36efa0a122ed393299d1207b6edd028069355b",
      "text": "哎呀呀，真是座气派的寺庙喵。\n整个人肃然起敬指的就是这种感觉喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00d3a82ddbe0a73ac85015558bda5edaa7965ea35ee7c781f471365963cf8079",
      "text": "好啦……带着信件看遍了镰仓的\n风土人情，你们两个，有领悟到什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:086d8aacc37a82359a49615d8b569ec4089bb01f259e6f4934d599a7041e80d5",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8286c6d0f6c62856977e9a067a646974898d63b2f7a95ab24c31c9d9359de4a",
      "text": "从刚才开始我一直在揣摩寄信人的心意，\n但并没有自信确定这就是正确的理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:130b4eda1f8de9f68495f18cffd5c271c794a2bb70d0bda18c91a551d8c1b638",
      "text": "其实在下也是，\n思路越来越乱成一团了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885384eb509d0b3366a4356a63e04fd3c86f775f3bf7a85579ee1b1fae6a85e6",
      "text": "想要触碰他人的内心，\n真是一件艰难的工作喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a7747923c836159610cee6c70fdd61ea2ffce3e948d5a0932adbcc8ff76a3f",
      "text": "寺庙的人告诉我，\n从这里一直往前走有一家图书馆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608ac810a458809ddb39960432a83611b784b41ae785fd9a565a460ec36c6332",
      "text": "听说那里收集了关于这个地区的各种资料。\n我们要不要去看看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56c1d1cf9364d139deb9c80683c6f7dec05416cf6f87fdf7027fe508d94c93c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，好主意喵！\n去那里的话，一定能找到突破口喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1644387455f58fedacd87e5b1c225a7a50ac03e1f7700a25c5f48ed4ebef84b",
      "text": "九郎君、蝴蝶先生。\n赶紧出发喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c43fe4333999fca8f30d947959012e7845c256c03f344be66669fd1841445174",
      "text": "图书馆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e28761e02323a7342728a07cbb3f363825701be59bccc7fef54e2ebeca3140df",
      "text": "喵呵呵……\n这家图书馆，到处都是宝藏喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b75290025aed88b1aa99a3b2cd7c722904c65d63c9f99dc42b23dbdddbf1e631",
      "text": "嗖的一下！\n在下先去各处转转看看了喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9030b6c80d48f2d6a0a46e26a9807066b91335b334532f27815a4f2de2529f93",
      "text": "我去向图书管理员打听一下\n有没有关于镰仓的推荐书籍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe3a24b2b0eab73826fba938cfc90710bc911837e9cf987aac7cd7202dd6341f",
      "text": "人家挑选了几本，\n去那边翻翻看啰。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a4def73fd0a0194024c6768fe777315a88010b3077d0cc3ecb763fd0be9f0d1",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n有什么事随时叫我哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f93237388ae067fe4a2554549944bf213f65cf8ee4901adbfc0a035149e739bf",
      "text": "（总觉得好怀念啊。\n那是初中参加完社会实践课之后的事了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4569e2cca9201a1e6a899780ac7017fc78272ef36a564c0e43d5432e64f76b9",
      "text": "（被第一次看到的歌舞伎勾走了魂，也是像这样，\n一个人泡在学校的图书馆里来着……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e0553d694051a0251c56e2d9d7054587439cc40b383cac07fc8c4fd38cecef8",
      "text": "（歌舞伎的世界竟然如此深奥。\n而且，是多么璀璨夺目啊……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26620a3309cce290c1594b7bcd8cb820ab05ac96c2c30a9c228d622d7a1b72df",
      "text": "这不是华村吗。\n又在看歌舞伎的书啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_f:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:646fd19becb20885b9661efa625ed0dbbe693693d80d984ccfcf0b800d4cc972",
      "text": "老师，正巧。\n我有件事想拜托您……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86fac42d861c5cc0c6ae92c325fc5292bb65cfcde16df97e0783ed768cb8651",
      "text": "好嘞，这样关于歌舞伎的书就都在这里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d87cbf834c2e5d60e5d82f4efb60ea5ef9df28a2abe16b27a783875fada0cc",
      "text": "谢谢老师。\n一个人找实在太辛苦了，帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:111f5ca72d8283226c205289e4db734ba20304764aad0b7c2e8deebebcba4135",
      "text": "毕竟那次社会实践之后对这个这么感兴趣的，\n全校就只有你一个啊。帮帮你也很有价值。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1980a43225fdeaef0abdb461f94adf3b86334afac6128695f78442fb4d97f302",
      "text": "我还是第一次见到那么美丽的景象。\n舞台上的一切都……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54b5e9f936cfb6b306608ab01bf7039903d69ab080a492b035ac3cf00b9113e8",
      "text": "演员的一举手一投足都闪烁着光彩，\n仿佛连这双眼睛都在兴奋地呐喊着。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:984d1451cf2fe3a824c672922fa64905eb344c0c5de93928e05cd80148aebc62",
      "text": "有特别喜欢的场景吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56e007bce79226c9f5392fa24b7d41f4df4089692a7ac03ceec9245a1330e261",
      "text": "像这样迈出步子，\n或是大幅度地甩头……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7dd2e510b962f6dceda29c4c6795ecd0874f0ee6e6f2ab089a8e5cd3af45db0",
      "text": "那个就叫“亮相”对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5561be0ff8bcf7fa854b50e1ab37eac3166d3a1d5c1fa616c4bf191e17e6206b",
      "text": "噢！刚才那下挺有模有样的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c02222054ba2eb9b8c78b48b848e4cd4ef47936571eef018ebc09d2b4198d84b",
      "text": "要是表演给那些叫你“皇子”的女生们看，\n绝对会引起大轰动吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42a31b3869eca2b299bcc2c9d5f07279f6172396d3331cc7decd4b7c1b1cbcf5",
      "text": "哎…………我没兴趣呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ccc28bd04f16af0953a9e377bece25acc4503e997b97d096aeae776c2e3d7c2",
      "text": "（竟然能遇见如此美妙的世界）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4792c13cf8b943411c5e7e69e082b25297a8ab1d3ca02c9165a3fb94794d43ec",
      "text": "（我也好想站在那片光芒之中……！\n沐浴在耀眼的光芒下，美丽地绽放光彩！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:638cbe811881bb6c051ac7f4719ae782b18dfe6f358349304d20b769d7c2d8de",
      "text": "华村先生，我借了几份资料…………？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:250f6bc59453d9ac12a270c32607cbec1799d80d707ca9b14999038fb0080dc2",
      "text": "唔唔？蝴蝶先生\n在笑眯眯的喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9635ab07de380f155efa0134620f957bb26cd974e6b5efd34e5bc34c4d9232d6",
      "text": "只是稍微想起了学生时代的事情啦。\n……呐，虽然只是“假设”啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30c2a7964e72aef8151e564648e3ca408d5065c0d7b8f4f502972761362121c7",
      "text": "要是我们是同班朋友的话，\n你们觉得大家会怎样在一起玩耍呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5418575ed1b4d4a8222d00abb928f528c2d953d08952ba12b039d0f05e5ee46d",
      "text": "玩耍，吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35fab3fa78c175afd47f4f333183fa51543f6b6ddaa337fcc7b32a4f4a3c7203",
      "text": "我在成为偶像之前，\n只知道茶道的世界。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34d3f0d730e8dda9b7be9df5b12975085403b739def52b89a0937cbef0bc5c56",
      "text": "和同龄的各位，\n也几乎没有什么交流。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:766327b7cb3f4296a5c3ffa2b2b7582b82572dfed212a73dd5d2d8aa6aac06f3",
      "text": "因此，原本跟朋友在一起\n该玩些什么，我完全想象不出来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dde20b69a1aba2db9b19bd52b3a21a1a3abc022136110f3e88216eac77d9efe",
      "text": "在下也一直以来\n都只是一门心思沉迷于落语喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e5e42e11cc0cab008a3d0e456c1dfa0979fb6c8d9e2933e3d8560b8466aea8",
      "text": "究竟朋友是什么样子的？平时\n到底在一起玩些什么，在下也不太清楚喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d2003a9c398a4548cd817b7e77ff73313c193dea4054e350c888e3677a93e5b",
      "text": "哎呀，那可真是巧了。人家从学生时代起\n也是一心扑在歌舞伎的世界里，朋友很少呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b00951420fb35b6e23ef93350c2345ee20384483deb1488def524454f9be857f",
      "text": "像今天这样的旅行和逛吃，\n虽然因为工作等各种原因也经历过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_h:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9cc3c022be5f5ee2b87f36bb0dd88aa485220ad8eb4a72899fe125d155772b",
      "text": "但能玩得这么开心的，\n和你们在一起还是头一次呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91c92d95416a9bb51d761ce423f01eace415db763cf3c47d748b76747d55f1e9",
      "text": "呵呵。大家原来\n都曾沉迷于自己最喜欢的事物呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8dc523c72a30568c4113c4c68cf472ac6573c3461248154915751d936644ad",
      "text": "是啊。但是……今后我也依然打算\n将自己全身心奉献给艺道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d49d9b6aa42df90a34cfbc2e5abca10e2a23863dadc4afa6496c9627803d9d9",
      "text": "两位也是如此吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba950dd6da31a0298b20483bd2f476b154ba2629e2a4c91dba953af36681835e",
      "text": "那不是理所当然的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8469efae0c55174fd906645d265ebf2c19b18a84c908a825426537d0cb15e401",
      "text": "当然喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9a4f37b60793ab136dc141cc675f725be35ad4c404f7eca6a1e0109b648617d",
      "text": "我们的生存之道是相同的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bba59a81334a00fdd4304cbde4bf2e549e76f409650cd75a99b53656ae1e224",
      "text": "能够奇迹般地与这样的同志相遇。\n这份缘分，让我想要再一次致以谢意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cdb8318715bf966f5bf1f8b822858ee4354886a382dce3d67b06f0c4548bc5e",
      "text": "喵喵……！在下的心跳，\n总觉得扑通扑通停不下来了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b042b38f148dd20bd4b1d4d610a0cc769a3d3e9a46d16f0b878d6beae56924f",
      "text": "今后也要三人一直一直在一起，\n在偶像与艺道上走下去喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71aec42846a0e45d79eede86a23fea0cba309150c4484573be64faac27951a9",
      "text": "……我们如今能全心全意地活着，\n也是因为先辈们留下了那样精湛的技艺。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b60306881d7f6af3b2a6c5cb04a77bf8bc116ab068587af11a28393659e2427",
      "text": "跨越时空，持续闪耀。\n照亮着他人的人生……这真的很了不起呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d7da8bdce9832abc6cf07470d46815ab3ee960deb20a080f97e1d71ff2f8406",
      "text": "为了报答这份恩情，留在此处的这封信里的光芒，\n我们也必须传达给更多的人才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4d73dfd5ceb7cfe7aa2b84e13786ee4be16a359d76efd38a0c8b05304343fb0",
      "text": "好了好了。大家一起来学习、学习喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000156:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7823f8c3b6be94411f17c1968ba69b64e83c516fdefe2ddece84d5a8321a6435",
      "text": "当天晚上……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000168:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0146755f5cfd3fc303d5fe2316365d59cb46504e275726746bb6e32ce40bf69",
      "text": "九郎君、蝴蝶先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000170:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62548cc8350a3a13e2dcf8b6c3ce9c21d0fd16647bc207fb5bef3818f0573274",
      "text": "一起买的同款钥匙扣\n挂在哪里了喵<emoji>image_talk_emoji_03</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000172:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7228566a3ce5acc0714bc77864f7e12d015219e43b2f06acafbb694d32d23a60",
      "text": "我挂在化妆包上了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000174:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eab1c03f058f93632eecbbd96a842a6cf41e7cc8e4df0adb86dde3e1c6226d93",
      "text": "钥匙扣的颜色\n和化妆包的设计\n绝配呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000176:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd17b68ceb8f1b98b25dbb150181023abcbdf6644b8b394bd4c720cbd13e971",
      "text": "我挂在工作用的\n笔袋上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000178:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26d3535a742fdb0e2d42dbbf2835e2896de875df79bece04c2c2753ae974108b",
      "text": "这样的话，\n随时都能看得到。\n猫柳先生呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000180:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f59f75082c14d8c91b22548f68e8e8a141c501724ffb8898cd8fc4cfd98d39f",
      "text": "在下挂在束口袋上了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000182:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a762936b2b0b25ddfa62b6a6a098739e9fc81405e262b6f4029478148db76ee",
      "text": "这样无论何时何地\n都能随身携带了喵<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000184:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2d8b58130280811e0661a961126e0317349754685c311dbd49d97fa371f4f1f",
      "text": "刚开始虽然觉得\n有点害羞，但用同款物件\n确实是件好事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000186:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8ed95e89dc433f2cc5239561da560ca241f25947302845222889e83a195341f",
      "text": "就是说嘛。\n保持这股劲头团结一致，\n录制也要加油哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000188:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54e4e48fe845801a5e3ba1f4103703ee392a29227b69909a8e283ceba0ce3058",
      "text": "期待各位的表现！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000188:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6da85ef9c838befbe3b1ccd8c3659ee06abe5e1b3fb9c625f3d5c3c25b3298b9",
      "text": "期待各位的\n大显身手！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000189:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b97842fa8ccf5c3b155bb1dfce40f44f2d320cbb5a8cf8252f98275a3ee16d0f",
      "text": "敬请期待！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000189:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a2482ac83cb0f84c39af49114261723c4d32724f516765974fc78da0403d3a9",
      "text": "我很期待各位\n会如何演唱这首歌！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000193:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db36adae5fb438c47412ba841c6ded756b44054ae3d2384486f9578f27c4d9c4",
      "text": "好的。我们会为大家呈现出\n最精彩的舞台。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000205:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14eaaed16f3b3cb15a464f8d455c33f196c1f51de91a324493de208201723834",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，\n刚才忘记跟你说了喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ad22aae17bc7bfd9f78cac1254d04f1f21f7826b0193d8fa0cf0a3ca685667",
      "text": "彩的大家一起给●●●●プロデューサー君\n买了伴手礼喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f60eab5bfeec1270f64d9af59e40d60994bcbeed898febb0c8d60badc044d616",
      "text": "已经送到事务所了，请查收喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000211:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2637a5c7e04f9a056a5febd6ae5b883e24db3ae6cfac0e492cd07c5e291aca27",
      "text": "什么时候买的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000214:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48afc7880b8ea097359d8afc7bd4c01e4c7b7863289843751fa131ddad5ad589",
      "text": "喵呼呼，趁着●●●●プロデューサー君打工作电话\n的时候，偷偷买下的……喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000216:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b2ba1811e66eef3e01a48e589b379c48c9efa25b3a8354c7e883e04351ba73",
      "text": "谢谢你们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000219:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41bfe2c461d5a22225746237160d9b5024ec0090d2eba8c964cd058163f93b6f",
      "text": "该说谢谢的是在下喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000221:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b61ecda29a7456955fb03231581515a7a100d640ab2835fbfc95082f0cae19f3",
      "text": "多亏●●●●プロデューサー君让在下能和九郎君\n以及蝴蝶先生组成组合，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000223:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7c64cee15ef17254dc90f455d4a1dbc7cff1a5981f16f0820b465ed2c2f1e36",
      "text": "在下每天都过得超级开心喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000225:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22f0b7aec6eb5aa1b1bc28ca7137d97c7e4e2438eed7f34dd003b54f645fef18",
      "text": "今后大家也要一起度过\n让人心潮澎湃的每一天喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_i:cmd-000227:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b08573c9ddf5d93fb15ae73d1c2d2e79cd6398bfab18bf0c3c5300c403d8b5d7",
      "text": "那么，在下就先告辞了。\n明天见喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "演出当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01496ac1341f69adeba34469987901759cdcb79f9d36f2aeba6e37d3c7010e00",
      "text": "男极“同步部门”的优胜者是……\n来自315 Production的彩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20a49f975464e1758caecf835a2a043d905d774274ecd626979c97413fd45fb1",
      "text": "精彩地贴近了信中蕴含的心意，\n为我们带来了美妙绝伦的舞台表演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa16410cb3057c985cf2a8d39dffd966bdd9f1a77005f162b9231950ce6cc183",
      "text": "这次舞台能取得成功，\n绝不仅仅是靠我们自己的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554767bdd4b2727ae940418bc6ea702cf90edd25fd71bfa6f2081fd55836582b",
      "text": "在下等人的技艺，正是因为有先辈开辟出的\n道路，才得以诞生的喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd315e3008d4865777a54038465c1e4fc06f4462bbda3963c40491ba350b868d",
      "text": "如果能由现在的我们，把继承而来的技艺\n以最完美的形式传达给大家，那就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d962555ce39f7b6d7e6f85591557d276ef0b29f4a9b82a4c65371b45e33075dc",
      "text": "现场的观众和屏幕前的各位，\n也请多多接触我们所热爱的歌舞伎、落语以及茶道♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42ae7d920a08a9fdebef0604afc88ac21a39c42e5ea56100f645f1099e0a3ac1",
      "text": "感受这些至今流传的\n传统艺能吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:034002ff81b3ab5b2a5b37fa6402dd0c4f7253186877296558d69baffb4c6532",
      "text": "居然是315 Pro获胜了！？那帮家伙拿到的信，\n明明是我老家库房里吃灰的东西……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:946574827b677ec529d13a729b1b5839f31d755bd8a4732da0bf083c097ccba2",
      "text": "说什么“先辈开辟的道路”。\n什么“继承而来的技艺”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c436e42d765641bdb35f07f1d6d7f607c6604713d42705c20382e9add93c800",
      "text": "那帮家伙说的话和技术全是一派胡言！\n只是擅长装模作样的演技罢了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_j:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:641719334e63b3f6b9670b450cdcf031d2acdada1d4bd35f8407d6cd9cabcb99",
      "text": "没错！下次，我一定要彻底瓦解他们的演技。\n绝不能再让他们继续得意忘形下去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
